    "Name": "Ebon Jaguar -- Cauldron Born",
    "Details": "The Ebon Jaguar Alternative Configuration C can be summed up by two words;  Cool running.  Configuration C is armed with 30 Tubes of LRM, 6 Tubes of SRM and two Ultra Autocannon/2s. Though this variant carries no energy weapons, it does have ample supplies of ammunition that allow it to stay on the field for long periods of time.  The Alternative Configuration C being one of the better Ebon Jaguar variants for deploying to biome locations that can compromise a mech's cooling systems ability to reject heat.",
